  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — LongtailGorg creature port (Pass 16).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `LongtailGorg` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713),
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  🔑 **Body needs no new BodyDef at all**: the donor's own `<race><body>`
  points at `QuadrupedAnimalWithClawsTailAndJowl`, confirmed VANILLA CORE
  (`Data/Core/Defs/Bodies/Bodies_Animal_Quadruped.xml`, also used by
  vanilla's own Squirrel-group races and Odyssey's own animal roster) —
  left bare, unlike every other body in this species trio.

  `leatherDef` (`Leather_Light`) is vanilla Core, left bare (same as Igitz/
