  ALREADY EXTRACTED, Pass 9, reused unchanged, no new art) — `hatcherPawn`
  repointed to `RSW_LongtailGorg`. All in RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml.

  No ability: the donor's own `specialTrainables` is unset.

  🔑 **`canCrossBreedWith` updated on BOTH sides, not just the newly-ported
  file** — RSW_Gorg's own header comment (Pass 9) and RSW_FrilledGorg's own
  header comment (Pass 8) both flagged exactly this moment: "LongtailGorg
  stays bare, not yet ported." LongtailGorg is that species this pass, so
  both files' bare `<li>LongtailGorg</li>` are now
  `<li>RSW_LongtailGorg</li>`. The donor's own LongtailGorg lists `FrilledGorg`
  and `Gorg` in its own `canCrossBreedWith` — ported here as
  `RSW_FrilledGorg`/`RSW_Gorg` (both already-ported species, confirmed
  directly off the donor's own XML).

  Sounds: the donor's own `lifeStageAges` block reuses vanilla-adjacent
  `Pawn_Gorg_*` names, NOT a custom LongtailGorg set — confirmed by reading
  the donor's own `<race>` block directly. `RSW_Pawn_Gorg_*` ALREADY EXISTS
  (ported alongside RSW_Gorg, Pass 9) — repointed directly, no new sound
  port needed.

  🔴 **Checked, unrelated, untouched**: none of this item's 3 named
  Mlie-touching patch files (`BehemothArtUpres_StarWarsAnimalCollection.xml`,
  `AnimalDessicatedTexPaths_Fix.xml`, `AnimalBiomeDuplicates_Fix.xml`)
  reference LongtailGorg/Kybuck/LavaFlea by name.

  Art: no `LongtailGorgArtOverride` mod exists (checked
  `find src/RimStarWars -maxdepth 1 -iname "*ArtOverride*"` first). This
  species carries the donor's own 4-variant `alternateGraphics` (A-D, same
  pattern as KowakianMonkeyLizard's 5-variant A-E set, Pass 14) PLUS a
  `swimmingGraphicData`/`swimmingTexPath` on every stage/variant (this
  species is a `waterSeeker` with `canFishForFood` — genuinely new among
  Wave C species). 38 PNGs extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py
  against the same AssetBundle every prior wave used — base
  `LongtailGorg_{south,east,north}` + `LongtailGorg_Swimming_
  {south,east,north}` (6), juvenile `LongtailGorg_j_{south,east,north}` +
  `LongtailGorg_j_Swimming_{south,east,north}` (6), 2 dessicated
