  alternate variants A-D each with their own non-swimming + swimming trio
  (4 x 6 = 24) — no unreferenced "Pack" variants exist for this species (all
  38 bundle matches for "longtailgorg" are referenced by the def). All
  confirmed non-zero and PIL-openable. Sits at
  Textures/swanimals/LongtailGorg/.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
